== '''ECFR Guide''' ==
[[File:ECFR.jpg|thumb|200x199px|An image of the current ECFR.]]The Experimental Controlled-Fusion Reactor, or ECFR for short, is one of the main focuses of the CPUF game. It has gone through many iterations over the years, and as such, has gotten more controls added on to it. This guide is here as a way to familiarize yourself with the current ECFR and how it works. It should be of note that anyone can operate the reactor, however, if you wish to receive rewards for operating it, you must switch to the Reactor Operators team.   
