== Common Roles ==
== Chaos Forces ==
A group of people (most likely rogue personnel) that attack the facility in order to destroy it and obtain the classified information (data). You can join this team if you have either the first or the second CF Pack (or both), you can find those gamepasses in the menu shop or on the game's page.
== Scientists ==
Personnel that collect and experiment on crystals, making different types and purifying them so that they can be submitted for ECFR fuel processing.
== Maintenance ==
This team ensures a proper structural integrity of the facility, by fixing the walls, scanners, coolant pumps and by refuelling the ECFR lasers in case they lack fuel. This team is also very important in case of a FFD event due to their facility access. 
== Security ==
A group of highly trained operatives that work specifically for the High Science as a private security force. In order to join this team, you need to join the HSPS server (you can find it below, in the "Factions Servers" section) and pass the Recruitment Academy. You can find more information regarding this on the server itself. '''Security personnel can enter the Security-only areas.'''

This team:
* Protects the facility by killing the Chaos Forces members and disabling FFD and Warhead events. Security also makes sure the ECFR doesn't stall nor enters the instability phase.
* Spawns with an armor (and can choose other ones under [CLASSIFIED] circumstances).
* Has one primary and one secondary gun, as well as a Security Keycard, that gives access to ALL the doors in the facility and allows to activate the topside lockdown.
* Usually communicates in team chat, using global one mostly for giving out warnings.
* Can issue the the ECFR's control room lockdown.

This team:
* Spawns with both Employee Keycard AND Maintenance Keycard, that gives access to special places such as the '''servers room'''.
* Can fix almost anything that is broken.

This team:
* Spawns with an Employee Keycard.
* Can put on a uniform and hazmat suit. Can take all the items in the crystals laboratory section, as well as most of non-combat items in game.
* Can work in the laboratory and collect crystals from the cave.

This team:
* Spawns with an armor that protects from bullets. Every member also spawns with a hacking device that can be used in order to open 90% of the doors.
* Can take 2 main weapons (AK and PPSH), one secondary weapon (Glock) and medkits on their spawn, as well as put on an advanced armor. PPSH and advanced armor requires some TXP to use '''(Adv. Armor - 1500, PPSH - 2500)'''.
* Can take items of their pack(s) - items required for FFD or Warhead activation.
* Has an official server - '''Chaos Forces Alliance''', that improves team's communication, has a ranking system and '''hosts official raids'''. You can find this server below, in the "Faction Servers" section.

